<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bhagyashri Pednekar | QA Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #24292e;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 2.5em; }
        header p { margin: 10px 0 0; color: #a1a8b0; font-size: 1.2em; }
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .section {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        h2 { color: #0366d6; border-bottom: 2px solid #eaecef; padding-bottom: 8px; }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border: 1px solid #e1e4e8;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .card h3 { margin-top: 0; color: #24292e; }
        .badge {
            background-color: #28a745;
            color: white;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: #6a737d;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Bhagyashri Pednekar</h1>
        <p>QA Engineering & Data Validation Portfolio Dashboard</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Profile Summary -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2>🎯 Professional Focus</h2>
            <p>Detail-oriented QA Specialist with 3+ years of experience validating complex enterprise ecosystems, managing user acceptance testing (UAT) gates, and verifying database integrity using structured MS SQL routines.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Testing Highlights Grid -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2>💻 Validated Core Applications</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>VSKY E-Commerce Platform</h3>
                    <p>Verified Stripe APIs, item variation parameters, and real-time sales calculations matching active TaxJar structures.</p>
                    <span class="badge">E E2E Testing</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Falcon Helpdesk CRM</h3>
                    <p>Audited multi-tenant data isolation layers to prevent leakage across parallel customer ticket accounts.</p>
                    <span class="badge">Security & Access</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Meldep Workspace Eco-system</h3>
                    <p>Validated system document version control routines (v1.0 to v2.0) and mobile app cache constraints.</p>
                    <span class="badge">Mobile & Versioning</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Toolkit Section -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2>🛠️ Technical Arsenal</h2>
            <p><strong>Testing Layouts:</strong> Regression Matrix Planning, Sanity Gates, Integration Testing, Boundary Analysis.</p>
            <p><strong>Tools Stack:</strong> Jira, Azure Boards, Postman API, Apache JMeter, MS SQL Database Engine.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Bhagyashri Pednekar. Driven by Application Quality.</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
